    sevenFactor odd.pos support possibilities
  rw [eq] at weird
  rcases possibilities with rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl
  · exact grid23 ha hb hc hd he hf hg weird
  · exact grid29 ha hb hc hd he hf hg weird
  · exact grid31 ha hb hc hd he hf hg weird
